\section{Overview}
This chapter formalizes the concrete engineering roadmap required to deploy
the AST-TSDME sovereign-kernel architecture on contemporary high-performance
computing infrastructure. Each tier is mapped to specific hardware platforms,
software stacks, and milestone deliverables, ensuring reproducibility and
production-readiness.

