\begin{itemize}
    \item Ingestion Edge Nodes: 4$\times$ Dell PowerEdge R7650xa (AMD EPYC 9654, 3TB RAM, dual 100GbE NICs).
    \item Compute Fabric: NVIDIA DGX~GB200 system with 36 Grace CPUs and 72 Blackwell GPUs interconnected via fifth-generation NVLink (1.8~TB/s GPU--GPU bandwidth).
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Software Stack}
